{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14548","headline":"赠慧上人 · 戴叔伦","name":"赠慧上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙槎江口槎溪寺，几度停舟访未能。\n自恨频年爲远客，喜从异郡识高僧。\n云霞色酽禅房衲，星月光涵古殿灯。\n何日却飞真锡返，故人丘木翳寒藤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}